// Pre-Technical Studies Grade 7 depth pass (18 Nov 2026). The first pass (13 Nov) gave most skills real misconceptions with short
// causes, few prerequisites and no teaching pack, and left three practical outcomes without a skill (use a computer, print letters
// and numbers, use measuring and marking out tools). Three knowledge skills cover them (the practical part is marked by the teacher
// with the KICD rubric); every skill now reaches two prerequisites (Science and Technology and Mathematics skills of Grades 4-6
// where the idea was first taught), four misconceptions and a teaching pack entry. Safety lines carry SAFETY in their source.
// Merged by scripts/build-pretechnical-grade.mjs 7. Draft until a Pre-Technical Studies teacher reviews it.
